OL,3,ABrief break from rain as sunshine
OL,4,Areturns for weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the spell of showery weather
OL,7,Fearlier this week, a strong area of
OL,8,Fhigh pressure is set to bring bright
OL,9,Fand sunny weather to much of the UK
OL,10,Fthis weekend.
OL,12,FDaytime temperatures will feel
OL,13,Fpleasantly warm - though a long way off
OL,14,Ffrom the record heat experienced
OL,15,Fearlier this month.
OL,17,FNights are expected to be mostly clear,
OL,18,Fleading to a significant temperature
OL,19,Fcontrast from morning lows to afternoon
OL,20,Fhighs.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
